        "emailType": "text",
        "message": "=A new {{ $('Prepare Document').first().json.doc_type.toLowerCase() }} is ready for review. The PDF is attached.\n\nClient: {{ $('Prepare Document').first().json.client_name }} <{{ $('Prepare Document').first().json.client_email }}>\nCompany: {{ $('Prepare Document').first().json.company || '-' }}\nTitle: {{ $('Prepare Document').first().json.title }}\nAmount: {{ $('Prepare Document').first().json.amount || '-' }}\nDate: {{ $('Prepare Document').first().json.date }}\n\nEdit the Google Doc: https://docs.google.com/document/d/{{ $('Copy Template').first().json.id }}/edit\n\nIt has not been sent to the client. Check it, then forward the PDF (or export a new one after editing).",
